{"id":"n90468-1-7","stage":3,"title":"늦여름 · 夏末","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n90468-1-7-1","ko":"여름휴가를 언제쯤 쓸 계획이야?","zh":"你打算什么时候休夏季假期？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"여름휴가를","meaning":"暑假，暑期休假","explanation":"여름휴가：暑假，暑期休假；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"여름휴가","audio":"/audio/2f326418aa384e842b6e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"22667","senseId":"1","lemma":"여름휴가","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"여름휴가를","audio":"/audio/86294d8ffec170c474c0.mp3"}},{"text":"언제쯤","meaning":"什么时候","explanation":"언제：疑问词“什么时候”；结合本句询问时间。","readings":[{"term":"언제","audio":"/audio/25f9ca42793d0a69dee9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17860","senseId":"1","lemma":"언제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"언제쯤","audio":"/audio/fd28178a926508f14a43.mp3"}},{"text":"쓸","meaning":"用、休（假）","explanation":"쓰다：用、休（假）；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"쓰다","audio":"/audio/e5721a077be2e027ff8c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71285","senseId":"1","lemma":"쓰다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"쓸","audio":"/audio/fe874efc41706f784970.mp3"}},{"text":"계획이야?","meaning":"计划，筹划","explanation":"계획：计划，筹划；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"계획","audio":"/audio/b0fe4ea3ac5ac4022d19.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"23324","senseId":"1","lemma":"계획","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"계획이야","audio":"/audio/d5bd177d992ee881fe8c.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"2f326418aa384e84","term":"여름휴가","zh":"暑假，暑期休假","audio":"/audio/2f326418aa384e842b6e.mp3","entryId":"22667","definition":"在夏季上学或上班的人在一定期间休息。","pronunciation":["여름휴가"]},{"id":"25f9ca42793d0a69","term":"언제","zh":"什么时候","audio":"/audio/25f9ca42793d0a69dee9.mp3","entryId":"17860","definition":"什么时候","pronunciation":["언ː제"]},{"id":"e5721a077be2e027","term":"쓰다","zh":"用、休（假）","audio":"/audio/e5721a077be2e027ff8c.mp3","entryId":"71285","definition":"用、休（假）","pronunciation":["쓰다"]},{"id":"b0fe4ea3ac5ac402","term":"계획","zh":"计划，筹划","audio":"/audio/b0fe4ea3ac5ac4022d19.mp3","entryId":"23324","definition":"仔细考虑并决定将来的事情。","pronunciation":["계ː획","게ː훽"]}],"audio":"/audio/fc0b88bbb1321f836c0b.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n90468-1-7-2","ko":"휴가철인 한여름을 피해서 늦여름에 휴가를 받으려고 해.","zh":"我想避开休假旺季的盛夏，申请在夏末休假。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"휴가철인","meaning":"休假季，休假期","explanation":"휴가철：休假季，休假期；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"휴가철","audio":"/audio/009d74e588ba92a0d08e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88405","senseId":"1","lemma":"휴가철","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"휴가철인","audio":"/audio/41343c0e43049e6ad37a.mp3"}},{"text":"한여름을","meaning":"盛夏，酷暑","explanation":"한여름：盛夏，酷暑；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"한여름","audio":"/audio/1f82eb48400eef9703cb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"85583","senseId":"1","lemma":"한여름","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"한여름을","audio":"/audio/e9d473b280c5ee1b2f76.mp3"}},{"text":"피해서","meaning":"躲开，躲避，闪避","explanation":"피하다：躲开，躲避，闪避；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"피하다","audio":"/audio/5b302c912e92db47d228.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"85911","senseId":"1","lemma":"피하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"피해서","audio":"/audio/e1decf9d6b31b9f2f3d3.mp3"}},{"text":"늦여름에","meaning":"夏末，残夏","explanation":"늦여름：夏末，残夏；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"늦여름","audio":"/audio/75a4604cf92e5fbf56be.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"90468","senseId":"1","lemma":"늦여름","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"늦여름에","audio":"/audio/474820e5dffc251d67d9.mp3"}},{"text":"휴가를","meaning":"休假，度假，放假，假期","explanation":"휴가：休假，度假，放假，假期；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"휴가","audio":"/audio/9e9f8123891fae1cf99f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73251","senseId":"1","lemma":"휴가","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"휴가를","audio":"/audio/1d69eb9c0dc086ec2b7f.mp3"}},{"text":"받으려고","meaning":"接受，收到","explanation":"받다：接受，收到；으려고：表示意图或打算：“想要、打算”。","readings":[{"term":"받다","audio":"/audio/5af01487318c0c571462.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66636","senseId":"10","lemma":"받다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"받으려고","audio":"/audio/ac3b82ca9fec2aa198e5.mp3"}},{"text":"해.","meaning":"打算做（-려고 하다）","explanation":"하다：打算做（-려고 하다）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62888","senseId":"2","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"해","audio":"/audio/b4ec4274b7799f1f17e5.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"009d74e588ba92a0","term":"휴가철","zh":"休假季，休假期","audio":"/audio/009d74e588ba92a0d08e.mp3","entryId":"88405","definition":"许多人度假的时间。","pronunciation":["휴가철"]},{"id":"1f82eb48400eef97","term":"한여름","zh":"盛夏，酷暑","audio":"/audio/1f82eb48400eef9703cb.mp3","entryId":"85583","definition":"夏天最炎热的时候。","pronunciation":["한녀름"]},{"id":"5b302c912e92db47","term":"피하다","zh":"躲开，躲避，闪避","audio":"/audio/5b302c912e92db47d228.mp3","entryId":"85911","definition":"避免遭遇或发生不情愿或棘手的事情。","pronunciation":["피ː하다"]},{"id":"75a4604cf92e5fbf","term":"늦여름","zh":"夏末，残夏","audio":"/audio/75a4604cf92e5fbf56be.mp3","entryId":"90468","definition":"夏季的末期。","pronunciation":["는녀름"]},{"id":"9e9f8123891fae1c","term":"휴가","zh":"休假，度假，放假，假期","audio":"/audio/9e9f8123891fae1cf99f.mp3","entryId":"73251","definition":"属于工作单位或军队等团体的人在一定期间内从岗位上脱离出来并休息；或指这种时间。","pronunciation":["휴가"]},{"id":"5af01487318c0c57","term":"받다","zh":"接受，收到","audio":"/audio/5af01487318c0c571462.mp3","entryId":"66636","definition":"遭受某种决定或判决。","pronunciation":["받따"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"打算做（-려고 하다）","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"62888","definition":"打算做（-려고 하다）","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/49f223e19c81193b7b3a.mp3","speakerIndex":1